                    "textcolor": [ 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 1.0 ]
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                    "id": "obj-2",
                    "maxclass": "bach.hypercomment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 1,
                    "outlettype": [ "" ],
                    "patching_rect": [ 6.0, 106.0, 607.0, 21.0 ],
                    "sendto": "bach.help.filtertags",
                    "text": "For instance, you can decompose 11 = 8 + 2 + 1 = 2^3 + 2^1 + 2^0.",
                    "textcolor": [ 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 1.0 ]
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                    "id": "obj-1",
                    "linecount": 6,
                    "maxclass": "bach.hypercomment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 1,
                    "outlettype": [ "" ],
                    "patching_rect": [ 6.0, 124.0, 607.0, 94.0 ],
                    "sendto": "bach.help.filtertags",
                    "text": "Each one of the summands will have a precise meaning:\n1: the element is locked (see #lock)\n2: the element is muted (see #mute)\n4: the element is set as \"solo\" (see #solo)\n8 (only for measures): the rhythmic tree is locked (see #lock+rhythmic+tree)\n16: if the element is selected (see #sel, #select, #unsel)",
                    "textcolor": [ 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 1.0 ]
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontface": 0,
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 13.0,
                    "id": "obj-24",
                    "linecount": 2,
                    "maxclass": "bach.hypercomment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 1,
                    "outlettype": [ "" ],
                    "patching_rect": [ 6.0, 248.0, 550.0, 36.0 ],
                    "sendto": "bach.help.filtertags",
                    "text": "The notation item flag is always given as last element inside the gathered syntax llll. To change the element flags refer to #lock, #mute, #solo, #lock+rhythmic+tree.",
                    "textcolor": [ 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 1.0 ]
                }
            },
